{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And I will turn to you.</b> After the destruction of the nations, as it says: כִּי אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה בְכָל הַגּוֹיִם וְאוֹתְךָ לֹא אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה (Jeremiah 46:28)." "<b>And I will establish My covenant.</b> That covenant which I stated: לִהְיוֹת לְךָ לֵאלֹהִים וּלְזַרְעֲךָ אַחֲרֶיךָ (Genesis 17:7)." "<b>With you.</b> I will establish it with you by your own merit — not that I will merely remember for you the covenant of the fathers, as it says (Ezekiel 37:26): וְכָרַתִּי לָהֶם בְּרִית שָׁלוֹם בְּרִית עוֹלָם יִהְיֶה אוֹתָם, and as it says (Isaiah 54:10): וּבְרִית שְׁלוֹמִי לֹא תָמוּט."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:11.111778540Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}